Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.66,0:06:08.78,Alternative,,0,0,0,,I saw that all the time on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.55,0:10:01.14,Alternative,,0,0,0,,Ahead slow. Red 20!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.24,0:12:24.53,Alternative,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.16,0:12:29.37,Alternative,,0,0,0,,2... 1...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.35,0:16:24.10,Announcement,,0,0,0,,All crew, put on your environmental suits.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.10,0:16:26.96,Announcement,,0,0,0,,Repeat: All crew, put on your environmental suits.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.68,0:02:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You wrote a good speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.51,0:02:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You honor me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.39,0:02:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans are foolish and submissive creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.69,0:02:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And more than anything, they bore me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.23,0:02:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Your post-speech entertainment is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.28,0:02:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}That ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.11,0:02:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.51,0:02:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Your Lordship,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.51,0:03:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}on behalf of your staff, I congratulate you on the 1000 years of Garmillas history,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.55,0:03:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,as well as the 103rd year of your reign.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.60,0:03:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Vice-Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.10,0:03:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The Great Garmillas Empire
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.40,0:03:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,has succeeded in uniting both the\NLarge and Small Magellanic Clouds,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.73,0:03:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,and has expanded into the Milky Way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.19,0:03:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The Empire's territory continues to expand,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.45,0:03:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,and your glory shines down, across the entire universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.82,0:03:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Our unification policy is working, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.87,0:03:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Those that submit to us are allowed to contribute to the Empire
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.14,0:03:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,as second-class Garmillans, rather than be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.50,0:03:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Truly a mighty deed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.92,0:03:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Truly the act of a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.34,0:03:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No enemy can
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.28,0:03:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}withstand the might of His Lordship and the Great Garmillas armies!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.93,0:03:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Garmillas is invincible! We will never be defeated!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.48,0:03:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Arrogance is a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.61,0:03:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}We must remain wary of
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.61,0:04:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}the barbarian invaders from outside the galaxy around the Small Magellanic Cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.74,0:04:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Admiral Ditz!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.53,0:04:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you calling me a boaster?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.58,0:04:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,As the Commander of the Astrofleets, I speak the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.04,0:04:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Your Lordship,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.04,0:04:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}we will eliminate these barbarians soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.84,0:04:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I've dispatched Senior General Domel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.55,0:04:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The Space Wolf?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.14,0:04:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he will live up to our expectations.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.27,0:04:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, I've prepared some entertainment to help you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.06,0:04:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,forget the stress of your difficult jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.40,0:04:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight, you will watch video from the front lines of the Empire's war.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.33,0:04:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Why would we watch that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.16,0:04:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Because His Lordship created the plan you are about to see in execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.92,0:05:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, everyone, let us begin the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.59,0:05:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,When you wish upon a star,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.72,0:05:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,if your heart is in your dream,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.43,0:05:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,no request is too extreme,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.48,0:05:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,when you wish upon a star as dreamers do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.98,0:05:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a bolt out of the blue, fate will come, and see you through.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.24,0:05:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,YRA Radio Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.53,0:05:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Our next broadcast will be at 20:30 local time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.75,0:05:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This has been Yuria Misaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.21,0:05:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's a wrap.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.05,0:05:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure it's okay for you to kill time here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.55,0:05:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm off now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.60,0:05:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.06,0:06:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a door up here that never opens.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.52,0:06:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And supposedly, a ghost is there. The ghost of a beautiful woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.32,0:06:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It just suddenly appears{\fscx75}—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.99,0:06:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I see those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.37,0:06:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.62,0:06:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yamato is currently around 8 light years from Earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.42,0:06:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,traversing the Sirius System at 18 s-knots.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.46,0:06:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be jumping 12 light years in our next warp.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.59,0:06:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That should take us to Gliese 581.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.26,0:06:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,12 light years?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.76,0:06:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This will be our last chance to see Earth through the Yamato's VLBI telescope.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.14,0:06:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanada.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.27,0:06:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.11,0:06:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.16,0:06:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,...the Earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.45,0:06:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We are 8.6 light years from the Solar System.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.78,0:06:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, this is how Earth looked eight years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.08,0:07:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Before Garmillas attacked it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.79,0:07:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, look well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.38,0:07:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Earth as it used to be, the Earth we're fighting to reclaim.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.09,0:07:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Shima, prepare for warp.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.97,0:07:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger. Preparing for warp.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.52,0:07:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamato has jumped.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.32,0:07:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,ID the jump coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.32,0:07:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Beginning space-time wave motion calculations.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.07,0:07:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Tracing space wake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.07,0:07:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Rear Brigadier!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.61,0:07:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Friendly resupply ship requests a rendezvous.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.91,0:07:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy, finish your work soon, and come home, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.00,0:07:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom's worried...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.00,0:07:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Desler ordered us to fight and die.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.38,0:07:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Hilde.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.84,0:07:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander Schultz, General Goer's resupply has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.93,0:08:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No way... Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.21,0:08:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we were not abandoned, after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.28,0:08:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Galactic Theater Commander Goer, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.16,0:08:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I am honored to be the commanding officer for the operation Your Lordship designed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.75,0:08:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.04,0:08:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Goer, what became of the thing I sent you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.75,0:08:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir! I'm sorry! The new torpedo...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.59,0:08:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The Desler Torpedo...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.92,0:08:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, the Desler Torpedo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.47,0:08:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We have already deployed it on the front lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.26,0:08:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Warp complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.81,0:08:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We are in the Gliese 581 System.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.94,0:08:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We are 20.4 light years from the Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.79,0:08:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the primary star, Gliese 581, a red dwarf star.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.16,0:08:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like the warp hasn't had any negative effects.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.41,0:09:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.58,0:09:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Intelligence Officer Niimi. I'm coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.09,0:09:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.00,0:09:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be going, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.34,0:09:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this a good time?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.76,0:09:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.80,0:09:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.47,0:09:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This system has a planet suitable for the human-colonization plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.06,0:09:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like permission to form an expedition to investigate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.31,0:09:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.86,0:09:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course that's true, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.57,0:09:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't we need all possible options, if humanity is going to survive?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.20,0:09:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Niimi, the Izumo Plan was scrapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.45,0:09:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But that was...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.92,0:09:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Port side has been hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.54,0:09:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Righting the ship. Tilting fifteen degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.59,0:09:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Some electronics are off line.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.30,0:09:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Detecting a powerful charged-particle wave motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.14,0:10:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.06,0:10:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Report!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.85,0:10:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems we've run into a hyper-dense plasma filament field.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.10,0:10:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What are those?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.94,0:10:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Plasma flares being emitted by a star.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.65,0:10:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,A solar storm, in other words.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.65,0:10:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Our ship has run into the edge of one of the plasma corridors.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.62,0:10:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But this isn't normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.49,0:10:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Birkeland currents are several hundred million times their theoretical values.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.62,0:10:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.42,0:10:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It means this has clearly been artificially created.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.75,0:10:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The rat has fallen into the trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.09,0:10:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Goer, am terribly impressed that you\Npredicted they would come to this system!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.35,0:10:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing. I thought it might be amusing to analyze their ship's course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.06,0:10:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The fun is just beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.89,0:10:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, let us have a toast to cheer our Terron friends on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.98,0:10:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hilarious!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.40,0:10:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Set a trap for them, and then cheer them on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.32,0:11:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Lordship does enjoy his jokes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.87,0:11:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Garmillas has no need of such disgusting men.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.17,0:11:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ghale Desler!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.05,0:11:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail to our Leader!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.84,0:11:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I have electronics back on line.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.76,0:11:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But we won't be able to contact them too many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.35,0:11:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Calculate the range of plasma amplification.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.94,0:11:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Find a weak point in the corridor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.52,0:11:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It should be somewhere out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.24,0:11:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Plasma gets weaker at three o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.70,0:11:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's probably a weak spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.74,0:11:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a distortion in the gravity field, to our rear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.75,0:11:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's warping out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.05,0:12:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Torpedo loaded!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.22,0:12:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire the Desler Torpedo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.76,0:12:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy ship has fired a torpedo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.64,0:12:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,20 seconds until out of interception range.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.52,0:12:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.69,0:12:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,AA System ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.90,0:12:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready to intercept torpedo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.90,0:12:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,13 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.77,0:12:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to intercept.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.57,0:12:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Time until out of interception range:
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.82,0:12:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,10... 9... 8... 7...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.53,0:12:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,6... 5... 4... 3...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.78,0:12:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the firing tubes along the ship's stern!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.89,0:12:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.17,0:12:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hit. We've intercepted the target.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.18,0:12:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.05,0:12:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.85,0:12:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.31,0:12:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sending video to Imperial Command.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.32,0:13:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.32,0:13:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see that? That is the Desler Torpedo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.61,0:13:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that gas?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.70,0:13:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Originating in the Mirbelia System,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.04,0:13:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,it is an autonomous, self-replicating gas-based life form.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.67,0:13:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It converts, unites, and absorbs material energy, enabling indefinite expansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.34,0:13:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The ultimate in chemical weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.17,0:13:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I threw a cat into the rat trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.10,0:13:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Unidentified object's energy readings are rising.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.10,0:13:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep an eye on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.40,0:13:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's absorbing the plasma and growing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.53,0:13:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If we come into contact with it,\Nwe'll be broken down and absorbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.74,0:13:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The unidentified object is approaching us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.71,0:14:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like a rat in a trap, indeed.\NNow we just wait for the cat to kill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.22,0:14:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I've prepared an exit for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.72,0:14:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Shima, can we make it through that\Nweak point you found in the plasma?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.85,0:14:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe so.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.89,0:14:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.39,0:14:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If we keep going, through that area...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.90,0:14:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.57,0:14:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,However, a giant star waits, mouth open, at the exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.03,0:14:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Will they be consumed by gas or\Ndisintegrated in a burning fusion reactor?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.75,0:14:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Or is there another fate for them?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.71,0:14:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,No other, of course. It is perfect, Your Lordship.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.59,0:14:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, let us applaud the brave decision they're about to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.26,0:14:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't go forward or back, can we?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.95,0:15:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Shima, full speed ahead, toward the star.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.40,0:15:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we going to ram into the star?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.28,0:15:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Full speed ahead! Steady as she goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.83,0:15:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears the Terrons have chosen to commit suicide by fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.10,0:15:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Temperature outside the ship is 1100 degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.97,0:15:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside, 90 degrees and rising!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.47,0:15:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Environmental control systems unable to moderate the temperature.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.31,0:15:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, why don't we engage the Wave Motion Shield?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.73,0:15:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, the ship's temperature will exceed the limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.98,0:15:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.69,0:15:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, put on your environmental suits.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.99,0:15:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep energy expenditure to a minimum as we advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.21,0:16:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Seal the bulkheads.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.34,0:16:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the Garmillas ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.00,0:16:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's 8000 behind the gas. It's following us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.39,0:16:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep a close eye on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.64,0:16:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.35,0:16:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.94,0:16:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor, you need to put this on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.86,0:16:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.70,0:16:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the heck are we running toward that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.74,0:16:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn us around now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.08,0:16:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to get the captain killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.20,0:16:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.66,0:16:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,My old wounds are just bothering me a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.71,0:16:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.25,0:16:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let me have a look, just to be on the safe side...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.97,0:16:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Pulse is normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.26,0:17:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No problems at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.56,0:17:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Just some work-induced fatigue...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.10,0:17:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I'll give you a nutrient injection.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.06,0:17:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.07,0:17:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been asked to keep you alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.90,0:17:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to listen to my orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.57,0:17:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Your condition...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.99,0:17:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm well aware, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.83,0:17:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Solar prominence straight ahead, at SK223.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.21,0:17:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Steer to port.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.17,0:17:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, there's a change in the gas behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.55,0:17:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's trying to absorb the star, and it's being absorbed in turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.47,0:17:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I see... So this is what the captain was after, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.45,0:18:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You incompetents!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.87,0:18:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you just sitting and watching,\Nas His Lordship's gas was devoured?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.37,0:18:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You useless, inferior races!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.29,0:18:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The entire responsibility for this rests with you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.67,0:18:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd better believe I'll be reporting that to His Lordship!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.93,0:18:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This ship will now make a final run at the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.73,0:18:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We go with Brigadier Schultz!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.06,0:18:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We go with Brigadier Schultz!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.49,0:18:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's happened! A massive flare in front of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.49,0:18:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't we dodge it, Shima?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.74,0:18:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's too big. We can't evade it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.83,0:18:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Maintain course.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.66,0:18:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai, hit the flare with the Wave Motion Gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.62,0:18:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.33,0:18:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hit the flare?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.63,0:18:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Repeat that order!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.92,0:18:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.96,0:18:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll hit the flare with the Wave Motion Gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.30,0:19:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Opening circuit to Wave Motion Gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.51,0:19:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Shutting all emergency valves.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.64,0:19:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Releasing safety lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.72,0:19:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Activating force injector.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.56,0:19:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Tachyon particle pressure rising in chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.60,0:19:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,80%.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.52,0:19:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,85%.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.44,0:19:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,90%.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.32,0:19:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy ship rapidly approaching behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.20,0:19:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hit to starboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.16,0:19:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ignore them!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.95,0:19:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten seconds before we're too close!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.37,0:19:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Energy charge 120%!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.63,0:19:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Firing Wave Motion Gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.60,0:19:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Head straight through that opening. Maintain course!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.86,0:20:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamato has broken through the solar prominence!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.74,0:20:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ship temperature is 3,000,000 bek!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.87,0:20:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.87,0:20:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Our ship can't handle this heat!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.24,0:20:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Stern is melting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.24,0:20:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We've lost control!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.04,0:20:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Glory to Zaltz!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.26,0:20:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Video signal lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.56,0:20:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Lordship! All responsibility for this failure rests with Schultz...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.57,0:20:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.61,0:20:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that not a splendid battle, everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.99,0:20:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It was quite an entertaining game.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.46,0:20:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyss...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.62,0:20:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.17,0:20:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The dead are to be awarded a two-rank promotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.29,0:21:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Give their families honorary Garmillan status.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.17,0:21:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Zar Belk!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.88,0:21:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That will be all for this evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.56,0:21:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Good night, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.52,0:21:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ghale Desler!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.81,0:21:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, one more thing, Celestella...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.31,0:21:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What was the Terron ship's name?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.94,0:21:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe it was called the "Yamato."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.03,0:21:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The {\i1}Yamato{\i}?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.66,0:21:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.41,0:21:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.96,0:21:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That weapon that broke through the flare...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.67,0:21:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's similar to the prototype that\NWeapons Development is working on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.59,0:21:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that true, Velte?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.67,0:21:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.47,0:21:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's wish upon a star again tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.98,0:22:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust our wishes to the stars, like dreamers do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.82,0:22:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,When you wish upon a star,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.48,0:22:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,your dreams come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.24,0:22:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This has been Yuria Misaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.24,0:24:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Garmilloids are the Garmillas's vanguard.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.91,0:24:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Are the words spoken by the one we captured the truth, or falsehood?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.04,0:24:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Does the answer lie beyond communication between machines?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.96,0:24:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What is a person? What is a machine? And, what is a heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.05,0:24:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time: Clockwork Prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.22,0:24:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There are 339 days left before humanity is extinct.
