Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.34,0:02:38.34,Fade sign,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\pos(960,1035)\fad(500,500)}Propaganda Minister
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.57,0:02:57.07,Fade sign,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\pos(960,1035)\fad(500,0)}Lord Abelt Desler
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.57,0:03:00.57,Fade sign,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\pos(960,1035)\fad(500,500)}Vice-Commander Redof Hyss
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.18,0:03:28.43,Fade sign,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\pos(960,907.5)\fad(500,0)}Velte Talan
