Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.60,0:04:15.61,Fade sign,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\pos(960,907.5)\fad(500,500)}Ghader Talan
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.60,0:04:15.61,Fade sign,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\pos(960,1029)\fad(500,500)}Vice-Chief of the General Staff
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.26,0:04:51.27,Fade sign,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\pos(960,907.5)\fad(500,500)}Heydom Gimleh
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.26,0:04:51.27,Fade sign,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\pos(960,1029)\fad(500,500)}Imperial Guard Information Officer
